# 13. RELATIONSHIP SAFETY

Validate all relationship operations server-side.

Before creating an edge:

```text
person1 exists
person2 exists
person1 != person2 where appropriate
both persons belong to the same tree
authenticated user may modify that tree
relationship type is valid
```

On person deletion:

remove or otherwise safely handle associated relationships.

Use Firestore batches or transactions where appropriate.

