# 25. FIRESTORE RULE TESTS

Add automated rules tests.

Must prove:

### Anonymous

```text
cannot read private tree
cannot create private tree
cannot modify private tree
```

### User A

```text
can read A's authorized tree
can create A's person
can update A's person
can create A's relationship
```

### User B

```text
cannot read A's private tree
cannot modify A's person
cannot delete A's relationship
```

### Shared tree

If sharing exists:

```text
viewer can read
viewer cannot edit
editor can perform intended edits
non-member cannot access
```

Use tests, not assumptions.

---

