# FINAL SUCCESS STANDARD

Do not declare the migration complete because Firebase code exists.

Declare it complete only when:

```text
frontend Firebase Auth works
Firestore production works
Functions production works
Storage works
security tests pass
tree features work
required feature parity is restored
production is deployed
production is smoke-tested
Render receives zero runtime traffic
PostgreSQL is unnecessary
old Cloud Run receives zero runtime traffic
```

The intended final state is:

# LINEAGE RUNS ENTIRELY ON FIREBASE.

Render and PostgreSQL are no longer required for production operation.
